  <History Date="27-02-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Updated to v1.02 firmware charts (added standard and studio control functions and macros)." />
  <History Date="27-02-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Revised speed functions and some scroll/spin wheel directions (note chart has numerous errors)." />
